      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm reviewing a claim for a warehouse fire in Rotterdam. Can you give me a breakdown of the primary risk factors associated with storing large quantities of flammable industrial solvents in high-density racking systems? Focus on the factors that contribute to rapid fire spread.",
